<PolicyPage title="Terms & Conditions" description="The terms that apply when you buy from the Jhumka online store.">
  <p>These terms apply to everything you buy from {SITE.name} at this website. By placing an order, you agree to them.</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p><span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: registered business name, proprietor name, and registered address]</span>. Our contact details are at the bottom of this page.</p>

  <h2>Products and photographs</h2>
  <p>Our pieces are gold-plated over brass unless a product page says otherwise. Photographs are taken carefully, but screens differ, so small variations in colour and shade are normal. Measurements are approximate.</p>

  <h2>Prices and payment</h2>
  <p>All prices are in Indian Rupees and include applicable taxes. Prices can change without notice, but the price you see at checkout is the price you pay. Payments are processed by Razorpay; we never see or store your card details. Your order is confirmed only once payment succeeds.</p>

  <h2>Orders we cannot accept</h2>
  <p>Occasionally we may have to cancel an order — for example if a piece is out of stock, a price was listed incorrectly, or we cannot deliver to your address. If that happens we will tell you and refund you in full.</p>

  <h2>Delivery</h2>
  <p>Delivery timelines and charges are set out in our <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/policies/shipping/">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>Cancellations, returns and refunds</h2>
  <p>See our <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/policies/refunds/">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>Care and use</h2>
  <p>Gold plating wears with time and exposure. Keep your jewellery away from water, perfume and lotions, and store each piece separately. Damage caused by ordinary wear, misuse or improper storage is not a manufacturing fault.</p>

  <h2>Reviews you write</h2>
  <p>Reviews and photographs you submit may be shown on this website alongside the piece you bought, with the display name you choose. Please only upload photographs you took yourself. We may decline or remove reviews that are abusive, false, or unrelated to the product.</p>

  <h2>Our liability</h2>
  <p>We are responsible for supplying pieces that match their description. To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect or consequential losses. Nothing here limits your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India, and disputes fall under the jurisdiction of the courts of <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: your city, e.g. Kozhikode, Kerala]</span>.</p>

